<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to AnyLicence</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:20px 0;">


    <!-- Main Container -->
    <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-collapse:collapse;">

      <!-- Header -->
      <tr>
        <td style="background-color:#3a3a3a; padding:15px 30px 5px;">
          <img style="width:140px; height:auto" src="https://static.anylicence.com/media/statics/logo.png" alt="Any Licence" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Body -->
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:25px 30px; color:#333333; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">

          <p><strong>Hi {{instituteName}},</strong></p>

          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>AnyLicence</strong> — we’re excited to have you onboard.
          </p>

          <p>
            Your course provider account has been successfully created. You can now list your courses, manage your redirect link, and start receiving qualified learner enquiries.
          </p>

          <p><strong>Get Started:</strong></p>

          <ol style="padding-left:18px; margin:0 0 20px;">
            <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
              Log in to your provider account:
              <a href="{{loginLink}}" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                Login
              </a>
            </li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
              Complete your profile & course details:
              <a href="{{profileLink}}" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                Profile
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              Access your dashboard to manage enquiries:
              <a href="{{dashboardLink}}" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                Dashboard
              </a>
            </li>
          </ol>

          <p><strong>How Lead Delivery Works:</strong></p>

          <ul style="padding-left:18px; margin:0 0 20px;">
            <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
              Every time a learner submits their details on your course listing, you will receive an instant email notification.
            </li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
              All enquiries are stored in your AnyLicence dashboard, where you can view full lead details anytime.
            </li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
              After submitting their details, learners are redirected to your website via your redirect link, allowing them to continue the booking directly with you.
            </li>
            <li>
              AnyLicence does not handle bookings or payments — you stay in full control.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            If you need assistance at any stage, our support team is available at
            <a href="mailto:support@anylicence.com.au" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
              support@anylicence.com.au
            </a>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Wishing you a smooth and successful onboarding experience.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>Sincerely,</strong><br />
            Team AnyLicence<br />
            <a href="https://www.anylicence.com.au" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
              www.anylicence.com.au
            </a>
          </p>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Footer Strip -->
      <tr>
        <td style="background-color:#ffb300; height:5px; font-size:0px"></td>
      </tr>

    </table>

  </td>
</tr>

  </table>

</body>
</html>
